{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Part of #148. Depends on the views fetch.\n\n- Parse the GitHub project filter syntax stored in `ProjectV2View.filter`: `field:value`, quoted values, comma lists (`status:Todo,\"In Progress\"`), negation (`-label:bug`), `is:issue|pr|draft|open|closed`, `no:<field>`, `assignee:@me`, `label:`, `milestone:`, `repo:`, free-text title terms.\n- Apply it to the already fetched items before grouping / sorting — no extra API calls.\n- Unsupported tokens are ignored with a `⚠ filter: unsupported \"<token>\"` notice in the status bar.\n- Unit tests cover the parser and the matcher.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:06:12Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":153,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: evaluate the view's filter expression locally"}
